{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3773","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3773/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3773/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3773/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3773","id":18233666,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxODIzMzY2Ng==","number":3773,"title":"Renderer fails if shadowCascade is set but no cascaded shadows are present","user":{"login":"crobi","id":577871,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3Nzg3MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/577871?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crobi","html_url":"https://github.com/crobi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crobi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crobi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crobi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crobi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crobi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crobi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crobi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crobi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crobi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":58674,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODY3NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2013-08-19T11:01:25Z","updated_at":"2014-02-17T16:18:39Z","closed_at":"2014-02-17T16:18:39Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Using Three.js r60:\n\n``` javascript\nrenderer.shadowMapCascade = true;\nonlyLightInTheScene.shadowCascade = false;\n```\n\nThis leads to the following line in `initMaterial` returning 0 for the number of shadows:\n`maxShadows = allocateShadows( lights );`\n\nThis in turn leads to the shader preprocessor variable `MAX_SHADOWS` having a value of 0 and a static array of size 0 being declared in a shader, which is not valid in GLSL.\n\nFinally, this leads to a shader compilation error, objects not being rendered, and errors in the javascript console.\n\nOther people who have encountered the same issue: http://stackoverflow.com/questions/17264825/three-js-shadowcascade-usage\n","closed_by":{"login":"mrdoob","id":97088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3MDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3773/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3773/timeline","performed_via_github_app"